      "content": "Previous NetZoo goal: Please run BONOBO to get a co-expression network for each of our 18 tumor biopsies; the matrix is labeled gene-by-sample and was centered per gene. I'm unsure whether the values were log-transformed before the centering.\nUser follow-up: I checked with the core: the values were log2-transformed before centering."
